{"id":"00346","root":"uni00346_1","name":{"ja":"葉月","en":"Hazuki"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"葉月","en":"Hazuki"},"element":"Natural","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2020-06-15","limited":false,"characterId":224,"profile":{"ja":"魔界の山間に生息する人狗族。風を操り、素早い動きと刀を使った狩猟で生活をしながら、魔界のとある山林を守っていたが、その地に埋蔵された豊富な資源に目をつけたノマドに侵略されて一族は山を追われる。その後部族は散り散りになり、葉月はノマドに復讐するために魔界を彷徨いながら力をつけた。そしてより強い風を操ることができるようになり、磨きのかかった剣技と合わせて敵を倒せるようになる。やがてエドウィン・ブラックを追って人間界に来た彼女は、そこで初めて対魔忍の存在を知ることになる。","en":"Hazuki hails from the dog-human tribe that dwells in the mountains of the Demon Realm. She commands the wind, lives by swift movement and sword-based hunting, and once guarded a forest there. When nomads invaded to seize the area's abundant resources, her tribe was driven from the mountains and scattered. Determined to avenge her people, Hazuki roamed the Demon Realm, strengthening herself and mastering even stronger winds to complement her refined swordsmanship. Pursuing Edwin Black, she eventually entered the Human Realm, where she first learned of the Taimanin."},"illustrator":"ユージ","voiceActor":"瀬名ゆず希","forms":[{"id":"uni00346_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[776,1552],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[123,246],"def":[93,186],"spd":[79,79],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["4","630009"]},{"id":"uni00346_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1152,2304],"sp":[260,260],"atk":[196,392],"def":[136,272],"spd":[79,79],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["4","630009","630010"]},{"id":"uni00346_3","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1528,3061],"sp":[340,340],"atk":[269,540],"def":[179,357],"spd":[79,79],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["4","630009","630010"]}],"skills":{"4":{"slot":"attack","id":4,"name":null,"hits":2,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":0,